Vendored web fonts
==================

The .woff2 files in this directory were downloaded from Google Fonts
(fonts.gstatic.com) via the fonts.googleapis.com/css2 API on 2026-09-23 and are
committed here so that building and running KynexOne never requires reaching
Google. They are unmodified subsets as served by Google Fonts.

All six families are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1,
which permits redistribution of the font files, bundled with software, provided
this notice is retained and the fonts are not sold on their own.
Full licence text: https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Geist — OFL 1.1
  Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)
  Upstream: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Geist
  Files: Geist-Variable-latin.woff2            (latin subset, wght 100-900)

Geist Mono — OFL 1.1
  Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)
  Upstream: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Geist+Mono
  Files: GeistMono-Variable-latin.woff2        (latin subset, wght 100-900)

Manrope — OFL 1.1
  Copyright 2018 The Manrope Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/manrope)
  Upstream: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Manrope
  Files: Manrope-Variable-latin.woff2          (latin subset, variable wght axis;
           pinned to 300/400/500/600/700 in fonts.ts, as Google's css2 does)

Instrument Serif — OFL 1.1
  Copyright 2022 The Instrument Serif Project Authors
    (https://github.com/Instrument/instrument-serif)
  Upstream: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Instrument+Serif
  Files: InstrumentSerif-Italic-400-latin.woff2 (latin subset, 400 italic)

IBM Plex Mono — OFL 1.1
  Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex"
  Upstream: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/IBM+Plex+Mono
  Files: IBMPlexMono-400-latin.woff2           (latin subset, 400)
         IBMPlexMono-500-latin.woff2           (latin subset, 500)

IBM Plex Sans Arabic — OFL 1.1
  Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex"
  Upstream: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/IBM+Plex+Sans+Arabic
  Files: IBMPlexSansArabic-400-arabic.woff2    (arabic subset, 400)
         IBMPlexSansArabic-500-arabic.woff2    (arabic subset, 500)
         IBMPlexSansArabic-600-arabic.woff2    (arabic subset, 600)
         IBMPlexSansArabic-700-arabic.woff2    (arabic subset, 700)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

"Plex" is a Reserved Font Name under the OFL. The IBM Plex files here are
unmodified, so no renaming obligation is triggered; any future modification of
those files must be published under a different family name.

To add a weight or a subset, fetch it the same way and add the file plus an
entry in ./fonts.ts. Do not reintroduce the `next/font` Google loader: it
performs a network fetch during `next build` and took down five releases on
2026-09-23.
